Plan item B-1 (local://brief-size-remediation-plan.md §4.1, §4.3):
- lock, callers and vendored bootstrap on v0.1.7;
- `brief_max_bytes` and the `promotion.bootstrap_*` block removed from .github/oracle-reviewers.yml;
- batch-land through `theseus preflight` (batch-land-review-capacity-gaps-20261105, same PR);
- decision record for D1, D2, D3 and D6;
- docs and tests.
The promotion is judged by the 0.1.6 rules (bootstrap problem). Accept it only after `theseus audit-coverage` on its hosted capture shows full hunk coverage, corroborated by a local v0.1.7 review. If the audit fails within the retry budget, it qualifies for the owner's repair-class relaxation (D9), recorded like the 2026-11-04 decision.
